#: gui.py:249
msgid "Select"
msgstr "选择"

#: gui.py:249 gui.py:562
msgid "Any"
msgstr "所有文件"

#: gui.py:358
msgid "mp4/avc1 - Works with most websites, including Twitter"
msgstr "mp4/avc1 - 兼容大多数网站（含 Twitter）"

#: gui.py:359
msgid "webm/vp80 - Better color quality, but larger file size"
msgstr "webm/vp80 - 色彩质量更好，但文件更大"

#: gui.py:360
msgid "Use custom container/codec"
msgstr "使用自定义容器/编码器"

#: gui.py:366
msgid "Video type"
msgstr "视频类型"

#: gui.py:367
msgid "Useful container/codec presets."
msgstr "常用的容器/编码器预设。"

#: gui.py:368
msgid "Custom container"
msgstr "自定义容器"

#: gui.py:369
msgid ""
"If you want to use a container that is not listed above, whatever is "
"supported by OpenCV and FFMPEG."
msgstr ""
"若要使用上方未列出的容器，填写 OpenCV 与 FFMPEG 支持的值即可。"

#: gui.py:370
msgid "Custom codec"
msgstr "自定义编码器"

#: gui.py:371
msgid ""
"If you want to use a codec that is not listed above, whatever is supported "
"by OpenCV and FFMPEG."
msgstr ""
"若要使用上方未列出的编码器，填写 OpenCV 与 FFMPEG 支持的值即可。"

#: gui.py:389
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: gui.py:413
msgid "Save folder"
msgstr "保存位置"

#: gui.py:414
msgid "One folder for everything. Each recording gets a timestamped subfolder holding the raw clips, and the exported video is saved next to it. Existing files are never overwritten - a _1, _2 suffix is added instead."
msgstr "录制和成片都放在这一个文件夹里：每次录制会建一个带时间戳的子目录存原始分段，导出的成片就放在它旁边。同名文件不会被覆盖，会自动加 _1、_2 后缀。"

#: gui.py:417
msgid "Auto split count"
msgstr "自动分段帧数"

#: gui.py:418
msgid ""
"Automatically split video output after this many frames. Enter 0 or leave "
"blank to disable. This is useful to mitigate the chance of missing or "
"corrupt video data after a system crash."
msgstr ""
"每录制这么多帧就自动分段保存一次视频。填 0 或留空表示不分段。这样可降低系统崩"
"溃时视频数据丢失或损坏的风险。"

#: gui.py:421
msgid "Image size limit (px)"
msgstr "图像尺寸上限（像素）"

#: gui.py:422
msgid "Captured images will be resized to this if larger than this value."
msgstr "采集到的图像超过此值时，会缩小到该尺寸。"

#: gui.py:512
msgid "Start Recording"
msgstr "开始录制"

#: gui.py:513
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

#: gui.py:549
msgid "SAI Recording"
msgstr "SAI 录制"

#: gui.py:552
msgid "SAI version detected"
msgstr "检测到的 SAI 版本"

#: gui.py:553
msgid "SAI version override"
msgstr "SAI 版本覆盖"

#: gui.py:554
msgid "Canvas"
msgstr "画布"

#: gui.py:555
msgid "Canvas preview"
msgstr "画布预览"

#: gui.py:574
msgid "Export Video"
msgstr "导出视频"

#: gui.py:576
msgid "Export file"
msgstr "导出文件"

#: gui.py:577
msgid "Export time limit"
msgstr "导出时长上限"

#: gui.py:578
msgid "Export FPS"
msgstr "导出帧率"

#: gui.py:579
msgid "Preview last frame first"
msgstr "开头先显示末帧预览"

#: gui.py:580
msgid "Preview duration"
msgstr "预览时长"

#: gui.py:581
msgid "Use recording video type"
msgstr "沿用录制时的视频类型"

#: gui.py:589
msgid "Stop Recording"
msgstr "结束录制"

#: gui.py:590
msgid "Stop Exporting"
msgstr "停止导出"

#: gui.py:592
msgid ""
"If the running SAI version cannot be detected, the selected override will be "
"used."
msgstr "如果无法检测到正在运行的 SAI 版本，将使用所选的覆盖版本。"

#: gui.py:593
msgid "Select which open SAI canvas to record from."
msgstr "选择要从哪个已打开的 SAI 画布录制。"

#: gui.py:597
msgid ""
"Path to the video file to export to. Extension is determined by video type. "
"Leave blank to automatically use the frames path."
msgstr ""
"导出视频的文件路径。扩展名由视频类型决定。留空则自动使用帧目录。"

#: gui.py:598
msgid ""
"Maximum time the exported video should be. Enter 0 or leave blank for no "
"time limit."
msgstr "导出视频的最大时长。填 0 或留空表示不限时长。"

#: gui.py:599
msgid "Set the FPS of the exported video. 30 is a common default."
msgstr "设置导出视频的帧率，常用默认值为 30。"

#: gui.py:600
msgid ""
"Display the last frame at the beginning of the exported video, like a "
"preview of the finished timelapse."
msgstr "在导出视频的开头先显示最后一帧，作为成片效果的预览。"

#: gui.py:601
msgid ""
"The duration of the preview frame in seconds. Enter 0 or leave blank to "
"display for only a single frame. This adds on to the final export duration."
msgstr ""
"预览帧的显示时长（秒）。填 0 或留空则只显示一帧。该时长会累加到最终导出时长"
"上。"

#: gui.py:602
msgid ""
"Use the same video options as the recording tabs and ignore the below "
"settings."
msgstr "沿用录制标签页的视频设置，忽略下方这些选项。"

#: gui.py:606
msgid "Theme:"
msgstr "主题："

#: gui.py:683
msgid ""
"Possible Wayland session is running because the following environment "
"variable was set:"
msgstr "检测到可能正在运行 Wayland 会话，因为设置了以下环境变量："

#: gui.py:685
msgid ""
"Wayland sessions are currently not supported by dependencies mss and "
"pywinctl."
msgstr "当前依赖 mss 和 pywinctl 尚不支持 Wayland 会话。"

#: gui.py:686
msgid ""
"To work around this, you can run this tool and your desired art program "
"inside of Xwayland, see README.md."
msgstr "解决办法：在 Xwayland 中运行本工具和你的绘画软件，详见 README.md。"

#: gui.py:688
msgid "Supported SAI versions:"
msgstr "支持的 SAI 版本："

#: gui.py:764
msgid "SAI is not running"
msgstr "SAI 未运行"

#: gui.py:777
msgid "(Override)"
msgstr "（覆盖）"

#: gui.py:798
msgid "Recording started"
msgstr "录制已开始"

#: gui.py:799
msgid "Recording stopped"
msgstr "录制已停止"

#: gui.py:802
msgid "Exporting started"
msgstr "导出已开始"

#: gui.py:803
msgid "Exporting stopped"
msgstr "导出已停止"

#: gui.py:829
msgid "No valid SAI process found"
msgstr "未找到有效的 SAI 进程"

#: gui.py:834
msgid "There are no canvases open"
msgstr "没有已打开的画布"

#: gui.py:875
msgid "Export cancelled"
msgstr "导出已取消"

#: timelapse.py:167
msgid ""
"Click and drag on a subwindow to start tracking an area. Right click to "
"cancel."
msgstr "在子窗口上按住拖拽以开始追踪区域。右键取消。"

#: timelapse.py:173
msgid "Click on a subwindow to start tracking. Right click to cancel."
msgstr "点击子窗口开始追踪。右键取消。"

#: timelapse.py:214
msgid "Window grab cancelled"
msgstr "已取消窗口抓取"

#: timelapse.py:264
msgid "Could not find window automatically"
msgstr "无法自动找到窗口"

#: timelapse.py:276
msgid "Writing to video:"
msgstr "正在写入视频："

#: timelapse.py:327
msgid "Writing to frames folder:"
msgstr "正在写入帧目录："

#: timelapse.py:362
msgid "Reading from frames folder:"
msgstr "正在从帧目录读取："

#: timelapse.py:476
msgid "Window lost:"
msgstr "窗口丢失："

#: timelapse.py:480
msgid "Tracking input for window:"
msgstr "正在追踪窗口输入："

#: timelapse.py:488
msgid "Stopped tracking window:"
msgstr "已停止追踪窗口："

#: timelapse.py:536
msgid "No appropriate frame data found:"
msgstr "未找到合适的帧数据："

#: timelapse.py:571
msgid "Canvas lost, stopping now"
msgstr "画布丢失，正在停止"

#: gui.py
msgid "Recording session:"
msgstr "本次录制目录："

#: gui.py
msgid "Using recording session:"
msgstr "导出使用录制目录："

#: gui.py
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

#: gui.py
msgid "This session"
msgstr "本次录制"

#: gui.py
msgid "No frames recorded yet"
msgstr "还没有录到任何帧"

#: gui.py
msgid "{} frames · {} source → {} video"
msgstr "{} 帧 · 素材 {} → 成片 {}"

#: gui.py
msgid "(sampled)"
msgstr "（抽帧）"

#: webapp.py
msgid "saves as {}"
msgstr "将导出为 {}"

#: webapp.py
msgid "Choose a save folder"
msgstr "选一个保存位置"

#: webapp.py
msgid "Recording clips and exported videos both live in this one folder. You can change it later on the Recording tab."
msgstr "录制的原始分段和导出的成片都会放在这个文件夹里，之后可以在「SAI 录制」页改。"

#: webapp.py
msgid "Choose folder…"
msgstr "选择文件夹…"

#: webapp.py
msgid "Use this folder"
msgstr "就用这里"

#: webapp.py
msgid "Choose a save folder first — nothing is recorded without one."
msgstr "还没选保存位置 —— 没有它什么都不会录。"


#: gui.py
msgid "Error"
msgstr "出错了"

#: timelapse.py
msgid "No frames have been recorded yet. Start recording first, then export."
msgstr "还没有录到任何帧。请先开始录制，再来导出。"

#: timelapse.py
msgid "Cannot create video file: {}"
msgstr "无法创建视频文件：{}"

#: timelapse.py
msgid "Codec {} is not available in this build."
msgstr "当前版本不支持编码器 {}。"

#: timelapse.py
msgid "The path contains non-ASCII characters, which codec {} cannot handle. Switch the video type to webm/vp80, or move the folder to an ASCII-only path."
msgstr "路径里含中文等非 ASCII 字符，编码器 {} 无法处理这种路径。请把「视频类型」改成 webm/vp80，或把目录换到纯英文路径。"


