msgstr "原始尺寸"

#: gui.py
msgid "Captured images will be scaled down to fit this size. Larger means sharper video but slower capture and bigger files."
msgstr "截图会被缩到不超过这个尺寸。数值越大成片越清晰，但采集更慢、文件更大。"

#: gui.py
msgid "Global hotkey: {} to start / stop recording"
msgstr "全局热键：{} 开始 / 停止录制"

#: gui.py
msgid "Tip: Ctrl+Alt+S starts / stops recording globally, even while SAI has focus."
msgstr "提示：按 Ctrl+Alt+S 可以随时开始 / 停止录制，即使焦点在 SAI 上。"

#: gui.py
msgid "Ctrl+Alt+S starts / stops recording, even while SAI has focus."
msgstr "Ctrl+Alt+S 随时开始 / 停止录制，不用切回本窗口。"

